{"version":1,"content":"<p>三星電子已開始為其位於美國德克薩斯州泰勒市的晶圓廠採購額外設備，計劃進一步擴大2納米製程晶片的生產能力。根據韓國媒體ZDNet Korea援引的業內消息，三星此次訂購的設備預計可新增每月約6000片晶圓的生產能力。如果後續設備安裝和產線建設按計劃推進，泰勒一廠的2納米製程月產能有望在2027年下半年達到2萬片晶圓。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583588.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T14:04:40.443300+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:42:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T13:58:09.629476+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:58:09.629476+00:00","content_hash":"1349e2442379cff639d8d1d379defc7a25a222a0fd24550ee29bb55ed43b90ca","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}